        "type": "chart",
        "chartId": "candidate-break-even-chart"
      },
      {
        "id": "evidence-level",
        "type": "markdown",
        "body": "## 证据等级\n\n20 mm 的正收益证据只到 **boundary moderation / direct-Cu current proxy**。100,000 source n 中 34,031 个首次接触 BPE，22,988 个到达内表面，条件通过率 67.5502%（Wilson95 67.0508–68.0456%）。Cu-61/62 indices 为 0.88476±0.01271、0.84215±0.01026；Cu-64 为 0.89656±0.09706，不显著。没有 matched 0 mm 的 activation production、selected W2、prompt、focused S20 或 F3。"
      },
      {
        "id": "candidate-table-block",
        "type": "table",
        "tableId": "candidate-table"
      },
      {
        "id": "coupling",
        "type": "markdown",
        "body": "## Production 与 detector coupling\n\n当前 n inventory 为 348.222 Bq，n selected delayed W2 为 0.0236791 cps；但 active scintillator 占约 69.8% n-Bq 而无 current selected survivor，cold plates/near-TES Cu/Nb/Mu 的 W2/Bq 高得多。full delayed Neff≈28.75，frozen Neff≈12.04；Nb-89 与 Co-54 各只有一个 n survivor。因此不能把边界电流下降直接写成 selected W2 收益。"
      },
      {
        "id": "isotope-table-block",
        "type": "table",
        "tableId": "isotope-table"
      },
      {
        "id": "signal-prompt",
        "type": "markdown",
        "body": "## Signal 与 prompt guard\n\n权威 card 的 BPE/plastic 没有随 BGO/Al signal window 开孔；现有 focused EventList 从 post-Be plane 起算。NIST XCOM 给 20 mm BPE 的法向 narrow-line T511=0.83069；20 mm 必须把总 B 降低 >31.0% 才净改善 F3。watched-volume run 另有 3,876 条约 478 keV inward track-first-exits/100,000 source n，提示 capture-secondary 必须在 BGO/plastic veto 前后单列。"
      },
      {
        "id": "blocker",
        "type": "markdown",
        "body": "## 唯一阻断证据与下一步\n\n只做 matched corrected-keV **0 mm vs 20 mm**：固定 plastic/BGO/Cu/Nb/Mu，比较 volume×isotope day-15 Bq、capture/prompt guard、exact-position selected W2，并从外包络之外重放各自 focused S20。预注册最终条件 `sqrt(B0/B20)/(S0/S20)<1`，且 weighted/compound-MC 单侧上界也小于 1。未通过前不做 10/30 mm 或局部重分配大扫描。"
      }
